000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.           TDLYTRNS.
000400 AUTHOR.               MK MADDEN.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.         APRIL 23, 1985.
000600*INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
000700
000800*REMARKS.              THIS PROGRAM WILL READ THE DAILY
000900*                      TRANSACTION FILE (ABSTFIL)
001000*                      AND PROCESS
001100*                      ALL DAILY TRANSACTIONS WHICH AFFECT
001200*                      STOREROOM VALUE, INCLUDING STOREROOM
001300*                      RECEIPTS, RETURNS, ADJUSTMENTS,
001400*                      AND ISSUES.
001500*                      IT ALSO PROCESSES DIRECT CHARGES.
001600*                      TOTALS ARE ACCUMULATED FOR EACH
001700*                      MATERIAL CODE ACCESSED AND DETAIL
001800*                      TRANSACTIONS ARE ADDED FOR EACH
001900*                      OF THE ABOVE.  A REPORT IS PRINTED
002000*                      OF ALL TRANSACTIONS PROCESSED SORTED BY
002100*                      TRANSACTION CODE.
  2200
      *C  07/28/1992         DAVE PLUM           REQUEST #5618
      *C  ADDED LOGIC TO OBTAIN THE ACCOUNT VALUE TO USE FOR
      *C  STOREROOM ADJUSTMENTS (SADJ) FROM THE MACCOUNT-INFO
      *C  DATASET.  IF NO ENTRY IS FOUND IN MACCOUNT-INFO, THE
      *C  PREVIOUSLY HARDCODED VALUE OF "000215" WILL BE USED.
      *C  THIS CHANGE WAS MADE TO THE HP VERSION OF THIS PROGRAM
      *C  IN JULY 1990 BY ABID.
      *C
      *C  09/23/1992         DAVE PLUM           REQUEST #6018
      *C  REVISED PGM TO SKIP OVER TC332 RECORDS THAT HAVE AN
      *C  ADJUSTMENT QUANTITY OF ZERO.  PGM TINVUP WAS CHANGED
      *C  UNDER THIS SAME REQUEST TO BEGIN WRITING OUT TC332
      *C  RECORDS WITH ADJ QTY = 0 (THIS WAS NOT DONE IN THE
      *C  PAST).  IF WE GO AHEAD AND PROCESS THESE ADJUSTMENTS
      *C  OF ZERO, WE WILL END UP WITH DTRANS RECORDS HAVING
      *C  ZERO UNITS AND ZERO VALUE - WHICH DON'T DO ANYONE
      *C  ANY GOOD.
      *C
      *C   08FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C   11/02/1994   CATHY ZUBEK    REQ. #6383
      *C     1.)  REPLACED ALL WORKING-STORAGE FILE DEFINITIONS WITH
      *C          COPYLIB MEMBERS.
      *C     2.)  CHANGED ALL PROGRAM REFERENCES FROM WORKING-STORAGE
      *C          FIELD NAMES TO COPYLIB FIELD NAMES.
      *C   11/14/1994
      *C     3.)  ADDED THE CAPABILITY TO PROCESS 423, 424, AND 425
      *C          TRANSACTIONS.  THE LOGIC CHANGES THE 4XX TRANSACTIONS
      *C          TO THEIR RESPECTIVE 3XX TRANSACTION.  THE GREATEST
      *C          VALUE POSSIBLE IS MOVED INTO THE UNIT PRICE FIELD, AND
      *C          A MESSAGE IS DISPLAYED SHOWING HOW THE FIELD WAS
      *C          CHANGED.
      *C   11/15/1994
      *C     4.)  ADDED THE LOGIC TO PROCESS 430, 431, AND 433 TRANS-
      *C          ACTIONS.  THE PARAGRAPHS WHICH HANDLE 330, 331, AND
      *C          333 TRANSACTIONS WERE COPIED AND MODIFIED FOR THE 4XX
      *C          TRANSACTION FIELDS.
      *C   01/19/1995
      *C     5.)  ADDED LOGIC TO PROCESS 421 AND 422 TRANSACTIONS.  THE
      *C          321 AND 322 LOGIC WAS COPIED AND MODIFIED FOR THE 4XX
      *C          TRANSACTIONS.
      *C
      *C   16MAR1995     DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED THE CALL TO SCSASRNM TO USE THE 80 BYTE FIELD
      *C     BUF-DDAILYTC INSTEAD OF THE 62 BYTE BUF-TC105 FIELD.
      *C     SCSASRNM EXPECTS AN 80 BYTE BUFFER TO BE PASSED TO IT.
      *C
      *C   29JUN1995     DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED PARAGRAPH 250-PROCESS-ADJ TO MOVE "TC332-DEPT-CHG"
      *C     TO THE "HOLD-DEPT-CHGD" FIELD PRIOR TO USING THE HOLD FIELD.
      *C     SEVERAL STOREROOM ADJUSTMENTS WERE CHARGED TO THE WRONG
      *C     DEPARTMENT IN DANVILLE SINCE THIS HOLD FIELD WAS NOT BEING
      *C     REINITIALIZED PRIOR TO ITS USE.
      *C        "MOVE TC332-DEPT-CHG TO HOLD-DEPT-CHGD."
      *C
      *C   16NOV1995     DAVE PLUM
      *C     CORRECTED PARAGRAPHS 240-PROCESS-RETVAL AND
      *C     241-PROCESS-RETVAL-431 TO MOVE THE DDAILYTC-TIME TO THE
      *C     TRANS-TIME FIELD.  A DATE VALUE WAS INCORRECTLY BEING MOVED
      *C     TO THIS FIELD.
      *C
      *C   SEPT 17, 1996     CA YODER
      *C     MODIFIED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C   10FEB1997     DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED PROGRAM TO HANDLE AN 8 CHARACTER DATE FOR THE
      *C     DHOLDTRAN DATASET (MCFPCA0900).  THIS FILE WAS UNEXPECTEDLY
      *C     MODIFIED FOR THE J.01 RELEASE.  THIS CHANGE IS A J.01 FIX.
      *C
      *C     ALSO CORRECTED LOGIC INVOLVING "MACCT-LATEST-CUTOFF-DATE" TO
      *C     HANDLE THE CASE WHERE THIS VALUE IS EQUAL TO SPACES.  THIS
      *C     OCCURS FOLLOWING EACH MONTH-END CLOSING.
      *C
      *C   MAY/JUN 1997  JIM COFFMAN
      *C     MAKE CHANGES TO BREAKOUT FRANCHISED OWNER PARTS IN ORDER
      *C     TO HANDLE DANVILLE'S OUTSOURCING OF THE STOREROOM. CHANGED
      *C     THE 'ISS' TRANS-CODE TO CONTAIN THE FRANCHISED ID AS WELL
      *C     SO ISC DATA CAN BE SPLIT OUT DIFFERENTLY. ALSO CHECKED THE
      *C     325 TRANSACTION FOR A FRANCHISED ID. IF BLANK, HANDLE AS
      *C     NORMAL. IF NOT BLANK, DO NOT WRITE THE 'REC' RECORD SINCE
      *C     THE PART IS NOT CONSIDERED A PLANT LIABILITY UNTIL IT IS
      *C     WITHDRAWN FROM THE STOREROOM.
      *C
      *C   29JUL1997    JIM COFFMAN
      *C     UPDATED CLASS CHECKING DUE TO VALLEYFIELD USING CLASS 080
      *C     FOR SOME 2300+ ITEMS.
      *C
      *C   28OCT1997    JIM COFFMAN
      *C     UPDATED LOGIC TO HANDLE INTERPLANT TRANSFERS VIA THE 'MM2'
      *C     MENU OPTIONS (TRANSACTIONS 335/435 AND 336/436).
      *C
      *C   MAR1998      JIM COFFMAN
      *C     CHANGED PROCESSING LOGIC TO HANDLE A TC532 INSTEAD OF A
      *C     TC332 IF THE "FRAN" KEY EXISTS IN MPLTINFO.
      *C
      *C   20MAR1998    DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED LOGIC TO NOT UPDATE MMATL-ACCUM ISSUE DOLLARS AND
      *C     ISSUE UNITS FOR "ISSX" TRANSACTIONS ("ISSI" FOR EXAMPLE).
      *C     THESE ISSUE TRANSACTIONS ARE FOR NON-GOODYEAR MATERIALS,
      *C     AND SHOULD NOT AFFECT THE MMATL-ACCUM VALUES WHICH ARE USED
      *C     TO TRACK THE MOVEMENT OF GOODYEAR OWNED MATERIALS.
      *C
      *C   09APR1998    JIM COFFMAN
      *C     CHANGED THE PROCESSING LOGIC ON 532 TRANSACTIONS TO NOT
      *C     ALLOW ADJUSTMENTS FOR FRANCHISED BINS TO BE PROCESSED
      *C     THROUGH CSAS AS WE ARE ONLY TRACKING GOODYEAR INVENTORY
      *C     CURRENTLY.
      *C
      *C   31OCT2000    JIM COFFMAN
      *C     FIXED TWO LINES OF CODE IN PARA 241-PROCESS-RETVAL-431
      *C     AS THE PARAGRAPH HAD BEEN COPIED IN THE PAST BUT THE
      *C     LINES WERE STILL REFERENCING TC331 FIELDS. NAPANEE HAD
      *C     A COUPLE TRANSACTIONS THAT WERE GIVING DEPARTMENT OF
      *C     '0000' WHEN '1500' ACTUALLY EXISTED IN THE TRANSACTION.
      *C
002300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002400 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
