057700*******************************************************
057800**   CALL 'CBLOWSRT' FIRST BEFORE GOING INTO THE
057900**   SORT VERB.  THE FIRST CALL TO 'CBLOWSRT' OPENS
058000**   UP A NEW TEMPORARY FILE 'BLUPDATA' THAT IS USED
058100**   TO WRITE THE BLOWUP INFORMATION IF A BLOWUP
058200**   OCCURS
058300*******************************************************
058400
058500     CALL "CBLOWSRT" USING CBLOWSRT-PARMS,
058600                           ACCTG-BASE,
058700                           BU-PGM-NAME,
058800                           STATUS-AREA,
058900                           DUMMY-VIEW-AREA,
059000                           FILE-STATUS,
059100                           BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
059200                           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
059300
059400     PERFORM 010-MAINLINE
059500        UNTIL FILE-FLAG = 2.
059600     GOBACK.
059700
059900 010-MAINLINE.
           PERFORM 9999-OPEN-STUFF.
060000     MOVE ZEROS                   TO  TRANS-FILE-RCD-COUNT.
060100     IF FIRST-PASS = 1
060200         PERFORM 020-GET-LAST-FILE
060300     ELSE
060400         PERFORM 025-GET-NEXT-FILE.

060500     SORT SORT-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-CODE
060600                                     SORT-CLASS
060700                                     SORT-STORES-CODE
060800     INPUT PROCEDURE IS 050-PROCESS-TRANS
060900     OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 700-CREATE-REPORT.

061000     PERFORM 1000-CLOSE-FILES.
061100
061200 020-GET-LAST-FILE.
      **********************************************************
      * 11APR90 - MOVED ALL DB FILE OPENS TO 010-MAINLINE.
      **********************************************************
061300*    CALL "DBOPEN" USING ACCTG-BASE                      *
061400*                        ACCTG-PASSWORD                  *
061500*                        MODE1                           *
061600*                        STATUS-AREA.                    *
061700*    IF GOOD-CALL                                        *
061800*        NEXT SENTENCE                                   *
061900*    ELSE                                                *
062000*        MOVE "DBOPEN CSACCT * 020-GLF " TO              *
062100*              BU-DISPLAY-MSG                            *
062200*        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP.                             *
      **********************************************************
062300
062400     PERFORM 030-CHECK-SEQ.
062500
062600*********************************************************
062700**                                                     **
062800**   IF THIS IS A SPECIAL RUN OF TDLYTRNS TO PROCESS   **
062900**   ENTRIES IN THE DHOLDTRAN DATA SET THEN DONT       **
063000**   CHECK THE SEQUENCE COUNTER ON THE FILE SINCE      **
063100**   THIS FILE WAS NOT CREATED BY 'BCUTOFF' AND        **
063200**   HAS A SEQUENCE COUNTER OF '99999'                 **
063300**                                                     **
063400*********************************************************
      **   11APR90 - IN THE FOLLOWING IF STMT, STMTS SUCH AS:
      **       MOVE "FILE ABSTFILE=ABSTFIL#" TO COMMAND
      **       PERFORM 040-CALL-INTRINSIC
      **   WERE REPLACED BY THE FOLLOWING 2 STMTS:
      **       MOVE "ABSTFIL#" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
      **       PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
      **   THESE CHANGES WILL PERMIT HP-3000 - AS/400 COMPATIBLE
      **   CODE THROUGH THE USE OF COPYLIB MEMBERS WDLYTRNS AND
      **   HDLYTRNS (9999-OVERRIDE-FILE PARAGRAPH).
      ** ---28JUL1992 "COMPATIBLE" CODE IS NO LONGER AN
      ** ----- OBJECTIVE.  CODE FROM THESE COPYLIB MEMBERS HAS
      ** ----- MOVED INTO THE PGM AS OF THIS DATE, AND THE
      ** ----- COPYLIB MEMBERS DELETED.   ---DAVE PLUM
063400*********************************************************
063500
063600     IF WS-SEQUENCE-NUM = 99999
063700       DISPLAY "SPECIAL NEW MONTH RUN TO PROCESS"
063800*******DISPLAY "ENTRIES IN THE 'DHOLDTRAN' DATA SET" *REPLACED*
             DISPLAY "ENTRIES IN THE 'DHLDTRN1' DATA SET"
063900       MOVE 2    TO  FILE-FLAG
064000       MOVE "Y"  TO  DHOLDFILE-CUTOFF-SW
064100     ELSE
064200       IF WS-SEQUENCE-NUM = MACCT-ABST-SEQ
064300         MOVE 2 TO FILE-FLAG
064400       ELSE
064500         CLOSE TRANS-FILE
               MOVE "ABSTFIL3" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
               PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
064800         PERFORM 030-CHECK-SEQ
064900         IF WS-SEQUENCE-NUM = MACCT-ABST-SEQ
065000           MOVE 3 TO FILE-FLAG
065100         ELSE
065200           CLOSE TRANS-FILE
                 MOVE "ABSTFIL4" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
                 PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
065500           PERFORM 030-CHECK-SEQ
065600           IF WS-SEQUENCE-NUM = MACCT-ABST-SEQ
065700             MOVE 4 TO FILE-FLAG
065800           ELSE
065900             CLOSE TRANS-FILE
                   MOVE "ABSTFIL5" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
                   PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
066200             PERFORM 030-CHECK-SEQ
066300             IF WS-SEQUENCE-NUM = MACCT-ABST-SEQ
066400               MOVE 5 TO FILE-FLAG
066500             ELSE
066600               CLOSE TRANS-FILE
                     MOVE "ABSTFIL6" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
                     PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
066900               PERFORM 030-CHECK-SEQ
067000               IF WS-SEQUENCE-NUM = MACCT-ABST-SEQ
067100                 MOVE 6 TO FILE-FLAG
067200               ELSE
067300                 CLOSE TRANS-FILE
                       MOVE "ABSTFIL7" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
                       PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
067600                 PERFORM 030-CHECK-SEQ
067700                 IF WS-SEQUENCE-NUM = MACCT-ABST-SEQ
067800                   MOVE 7 TO FILE-FLAG
067900                 ELSE
068000                   CLOSE TRANS-FILE
                         MOVE "ABSTFIL8" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
                         PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
068300                   PERFORM 030-CHECK-SEQ
068400                   IF WS-SEQUENCE-NUM = MACCT-ABST-SEQ
068500                     MOVE 8 TO FILE-FLAG
068600                   ELSE
068700                     CLOSE TRANS-FILE
                           MOVE "ABSTFIL9" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
                           PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
069000                     PERFORM 030-CHECK-SEQ
069100                     IF WS-SEQUENCE-NUM = MACCT-ABST-SEQ
069200                       MOVE 9 TO FILE-FLAG
      *--- COMMENTED OUT REFERENCE TO ABSTFL10 BECAUSE SOMETIMES THE
      *--- FILE IS REFERRED TO AS "ABSTFI10" AND OTHER TIMES "ABSTFL10."
      *--- DECIDED THAT WE DON'T NEED TO CHECK THROUGH NUMBER 10 TO
      *--- ELIMINATE ANY ERRORS THAT WOULD OCCUR.    1/13/1995
      *                    ELSE
      *                      CLOSE TRANS-FILE
      *                      MOVE "ABSTFL10" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
      *                      PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
      *                      PERFORM 030-CHECK-SEQ
      *                      IF WS-SEQUENCE-NUM = MACCT-ABST-SEQ
      *                        MOVE 10 TO FILE-FLAG
070000                       ELSE
070100                         MOVE 2 TO ERR-FLAG
                               MOVE
070200                        "SEQ NUMBER IN ABST NOT CORRECT * 020-GLF"
070300                           TO PRT-ERROR
070400                         MOVE WS-SEQUENCE-NUM TO ABST-SEQ-PRT
070500                         MOVE MACCT-ABST-SEQ TO CORR-SEQ-PRT
070600                         OPEN OUTPUT ONLINE-ERR
070700                         PERFORM 995-ERROR-PRT
070800                         MOVE "SEQ # ERROR * 020-GLF"
                                 TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
070900                         MOVE WS-SEQUENCE-NUM
                                 TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
071000                         MOVE MACCT-ABST-SEQ
                                 TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
071100                         PERFORM 990-BLOWUP.
071200
071300     DISPLAY "WS-SEQUENCE-NUM = " WS-SEQUENCE-NUM.
071400     DISPLAY "MACCT-ABST-SEQ = " MACCT-ABST-SEQ.
071500
071600 025-GET-NEXT-FILE.
063400*********************************************************
      **   11APR90 - IN THE FOLLOWING IF STMT, STMTS SUCH AS:
      **       MOVE "FILE ABSTFILE=ABSTFIL#" TO COMMAND
      **       PERFORM 040-CALL-INTRINSIC
      **   WERE REPLACED BY THE FOLLOWING 2 STMTS:
      **       MOVE "ABSTFIL#" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
      **       PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
      **   THESE CHANGES WILL PERMIT HP-3000 - AS/400 COMPATIBLE
      **   CODE THROUGH THE USE OF COPYLIB MEMBERS WDLYTRNS AND
      **   HDLYTRNS (9999-OVERRIDE-FILE PARAGRAPH).
      ** ---28JUL1992 "COMPATIBLE" CODE IS NO LONGER AN OBJECTIVE.
      ** ----- CODE FROM THESE COPYLIB MEMBERS WAS MOVED INTO THE
      ** ----- PROGRAM ON THIS DATE.   --DAVE PLUM
063400*********************************************************
071700     IF FILE-FLAG = 10
             MOVE "ABSTFIL9" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
             PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
072000       MOVE 9 TO FILE-FLAG
072100     ELSE
072200       IF FILE-FLAG = 9
               MOVE "ABSTFIL8" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
               PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
072500         MOVE 8 TO FILE-FLAG
072600       ELSE
072700         IF FILE-FLAG = 8
                 MOVE "ABSTFIL7" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
                 PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
073000           MOVE 7 TO FILE-FLAG
073100         ELSE
073200           IF FILE-FLAG = 7
                   MOVE "ABSTFIL6" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
                   PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
073500             MOVE 6 TO FILE-FLAG
073600           ELSE
073700             IF FILE-FLAG = 6
                     MOVE "ABSTFIL5" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
                     PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
074000               MOVE 5 TO FILE-FLAG
074100             ELSE
074200               IF FILE-FLAG = 5
                       MOVE "ABSTFIL4" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
                       PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
074500                 MOVE 4 TO FILE-FLAG
074600               ELSE
074700                 IF FILE-FLAG = 4
                         MOVE "ABSTFIL3" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
                         PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
075000                   MOVE 3 TO FILE-FLAG
075100                 ELSE
075200                   IF FILE-FLAG = 3
                           MOVE "ABSTFIL2" TO ABSTFILE-FILE-NAME
                           PERFORM 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE
075500                     MOVE 2 TO FILE-FLAG.
075600
075700 030-CHECK-SEQ.
075800     OPEN INPUT TRANS-FILE.
075900     PERFORM 575-READ-ABSTFILE.
076000     PERFORM 530-GET-MACCT-SEQ.
      *------ RELEASE THE MACCOUNT-INFO RECORD LOCKED BY
      *------ 530-GET-MACCT-SEQ (NEEDED ON AS/400 SYSTEM ONLY)
           PERFORM 9999-RESET-MACCOUNT-INFO-IK-O.
076100
      **************************************************************
      * 11APR90 - REPLACED THE FOLLOWING PARAGRAPH WITH THE MACHINE
      *           DEPENDENT ROUTINE 9999-OVERRIDE-FILE FOUND IN
      *           COPYLIB MEMBER HDLYTRNS.
      * ---28JUL1992 CODE FROM HDLYTRNS WAS MOVED INTO THIS PGM.
      **************************************************************
076200*040-CALL-INTRINSIC.                                         *
076300*    CALL INTRINSIC "COMMAND" USING COMMAND-IMAGE,           *
076400*                COMMAND-ERROR, COMMAND-PARM.                *
076500*    IF COMMAND-ERROR NOT = 0                                *
076600*        MOVE "COMMAND INTRINSIC FAILED" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG   *
076700*        MOVE COMMAND-ERROR       TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD9 (1)    *
076800*        MOVE COMMAND-PARM        TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)     *
076900*        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP.                                 *
      **************************************************************
077000
077100
