078500     IF FIRST-PASS = 1
078600         OPEN OUTPUT ONLINE-ERR
078700     ELSE
078800         OPEN OUTPUT ONLINE-ERR
078900              INPUT  TRANS-FILE
079000         MOVE SPACES TO BU-DISPLAY-AREA.

      **************************************************************
