                  (TRANS-CLASS > 399 AND TRANS-CLASS < 500)
                   COMPUTE TRANS-VALUE ROUNDED = TC336-QTY *
                                         STR-STD-COST
                     IF TRANS-CLASS = 206
                         NEXT SENTENCE
