           MOVE DDAILYTC-TIME           TO TRANS-TIME.
           MOVE SPACES                  TO TRANS-EMP.
           MOVE TC431-DEPT              TO TRANS-DEPT.
           IF TC431-EXP-CLASS > "009999"
               MOVE TC431-EXP-CLASS TO TRANS-ACCT
               MOVE "0000" TO TRANS-DEPT
           ELSE
