                   MOVE TC431-EXP-CLASS TO TRANS-ACCT
               ELSE
                   IF TC431-EXP-CLASS = "000290"
                       MOVE TC431-EXP-CLASS TO TRANS-ACCT
                   ELSE
                       MOVE MATL-ACCOUNT TO TRANS-ACCT.
           IF MCHT-DEPT-TYPE = "CL"
               MOVE SPACES TO TRANS-ACCT.
           MOVE TC431-QTY               TO TRANS-QTY.
           IF TC431-QTY < 0
               COMPUTE TC431-TOT-COST = TC431-TOT-COST * -1.
           COMPUTE TRANS-VALUE ROUNDED = TC431-TOT-COST * 1.
