               PERFORM 550-UPDATE-MMATL-ACCUM.

           ADD 1 TO 4XX-COUNT.
           DISPLAY 4XX-COUNT, ":  TRANSACTION  433  PROCESSED -- ",
                   "CORPORATE CODE  ", TC433-CORPCODE.
           DISPLAY BUF-TC433.
