240900**   USERS REFERENCE WHEN DOING THE MONTH END CLOSING.    **
241000**   IF THE DATE AND TIME ARE GREATER THAN THE MONTH-END  **
241100**   CUTOFF DATE AND TIME THEN DONT USE. THIS CAN ONLY    **
241200**   HAPPEN ON RAW MATERIALS THAT HAVE A PRODUCTION DATE  **
241300**   LESS THAN THE MONTH-END CLOSING DATE BUT A TC DATE   **
241400**   GREATER THEN THE MONTH-END CLOSING DATE SINCE NO     **
241500**   OTHER TRANSACTIONS WITH A DATE GREATER THEN MONTH    **
241600**   END CLOSING DATE WILL BE PROCESSED                   **
