      *------ 11APR90 - REVISED TO VALIDATE "DEPT" USING MCHT-ACCTS
      *------ PRIOR TO ATTEMPTING THE "DBPUT".  DBPUT COND-WORD 102
      *------ WOULD NEVER OCCUR ON AN AS/400 SYSTEM.

