304000     MOVE TRANS-QTY-TOT TO PRT-QTY.
304100     MOVE TRANS-VALUE-TOT TO PRT-VALUE.
304200     WRITE PRT-REC FROM DETAIL-LINE AFTER 2.
304300     WRITE PRT-REC FROM BLANK-LINE AFTER 2.
