304500     IF LINE-CNT > 55
304600         PERFORM 750-PRINT-HEADINGS.
304700     MOVE SPACES TO PRT-REC
304800                    DETAIL-LINE.
304900     MOVE SORT-CODE TO SAVE-CODE.
