           MOVE DATE-UNFORMATTED-TIME-OUT TO TIME-DIV.
305800     MOVE HH-DIV TO HH-H2.
305900     MOVE MM-DIV TO MM-H2.
306000     MOVE SS-DIV TO SS-H2.
