306300     MOVE "DAILY TRANSACTION REPORT" TO RPT-H2.
306400     WRITE PRT-REC FROM HEADER1 AFTER ADVANCING NEW-PAGE.
306500     WRITE PRT-REC FROM HEADER2 AFTER 1.
306600     WRITE PRT-REC FROM HEADER3 AFTER 2.
306700     WRITE PRT-REC FROM HEADER4 AFTER 1.
