307600                                      DL105B-OLD-CODE.
307700     MOVE SORT-DOCUMENT-NUM        TO DL105-NEW-CODE.
307800     WRITE PRT-REC FROM DETAIL-LINE-105 AFTER ADVANCING 1.
307900     WRITE PRT-REC FROM DETAIL-LINE-105B AFTER ADVANCING 1.
308000     WRITE PRT-REC FROM BLANK-LINE      AFTER ADVANCING 1.
308100     ADD 3  TO LINE-CNT.
308200     RETURN SORT-FILE
308300         AT END
